{"title":"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems#Problem_1\" title=\"2021 AMC 10B Problems\">2021 AMC 10B #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems#Problem_1\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems\">2021 AMC 12B #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_savannahsolver\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by savannahsolver</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Basic_Computation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Basic Computation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Just_1_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Just 1 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23d2e52b15a018d3bc52ad07b27d1e263429003d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|&lt;3\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/35211975309cd6693960267faef3e7d1e4ae7b02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} ~9 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} ~10 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} ~18 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} ~19 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} ~20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e061d35afcd7937b7ee34765c01f166217bef83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\pi\\approx9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, we multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a483ee25b066703890405f0127fef9c31572fb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to account for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/861c03cf6935c7b1e8407ffd155ae0adb0a1d8b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~smarty101 and edited by Tony_Li2007 and sl_hc\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23d2e52b15a018d3bc52ad07b27d1e263429003d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|&lt;3\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b7822aebffad0fc070fac8929eb45da399e369f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\iff$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"37\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aa10c7e5a9aea31792d5e989114807588693c0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3\\pi&lt;x&lt;3\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"112\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b96e281382af234b80bf4333d96fe86bd3bdaf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d4a39c601726949a5cfde4a9bbd8d30a64fb56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\pi$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/9/119d44ee0c69bf7e5ec27134d9c942bfb181298a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />. We are trying to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b03ab08c0e5eebded485889b9570b90b95780c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9.42&lt;x&lt;9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"137\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e1fc2610d0ab9747b552684df1356df224e62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b03ab08c0e5eebded485889b9570b90b95780c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9.42&lt;x&lt;9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"137\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea1231634d16d089bc562963f732dac67fe6a36c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9\\leq x\\leq9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" />, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e1fc2610d0ab9747b552684df1356df224e62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. The number of integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/f/0df7a361594dd6cb22938d7a64903c2e1b9c0fbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-(-9)+1=19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/861c03cf6935c7b1e8407ffd155ae0adb0a1d8b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ {TSun} ~\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c54c99892dd0942290301c74e1b0034f8fc43e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\pi \\approx 9.42.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" /> There are two cases here.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c888ef4fe1ac7c3b193604cde5135a3eca9393c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0, |x|&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/887dbb5f4f2e1b208c0a4eb2899feea2713808a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = |x|.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> So then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e75e154706d6795386b910581cdaf4e016693b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c87c23a846ee2b8dcc4a6b0cfe55c462623df00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0, |x|&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/8/308042f00628d2ceffb1f8d11f035f051b32be2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -|x|.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" /> So then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/4/fa464767201dba3ff10cc72e2bb35384dcb6e9e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x&lt;9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />. Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and flipping the sign, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d1445395b060b3c0198a55b99516b78b6c26b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;-9.42.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>From case 1 and 2, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c53a614e4bf4ae22d47deeb211262b72d5ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9.42 &lt; x &lt; 9.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"137\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a483ee25b066703890405f0127fef9c31572fb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. There are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c62150a3dcfbbbd3518e32f4a819392326e7eef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9-(-9) + 1 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~19} \\text{ integers}.\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"28\" />\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:PureSwag\" title=\"User:PureSwag\">PureSwag</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the problem, we see that instead of directly saying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we see that it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/9/2697836c7457680f6639d776d0b2438cdbc33c99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x|.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> That means all the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in this case are positive and negative. Rounding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/a/bcae34926788f40c2b1fceb43db3b5aeea3d94bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(3)=9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> positive solutions and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> negative solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e333e2e0f3ea0fe475c21a43e32e7174b8e7d4cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+9=18.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> But what about zero? Even though zero is neither negative nor positive, but we still need to add it into the solution. Hence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1aca8973f0c13090d5a07936f3b1f2d6e42cd7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+9+1=18+1=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~19}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"241\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~DuoDuoling0\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are an odd number of integer solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to this inequality since if any non-zero integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies this inequality, then so does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff0f5de19e70a0c97c8330b86e0289e27bfd025.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"11\" /> and we must also account for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced6b9b2e75857b566f1e516560c4a4d63977299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> which gives us the desired. Then, the answer is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6d83615701ee2c7146b42a9ddaec6d734aca3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" /> and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42a1f7b59384fdd70994c82a3bde5ffab68e1f1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\pi &gt; 3 \\cdot 3 &gt; 9,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" /> the answer is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63ac7e4fceeb0b51b095db32bd166fbf242c08ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 2 + 1 = 19,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" /> yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578f2e9e8a0f7ac924d5489e5b659346590e5c0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~19}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"68\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_savannahsolver\">Video Solution by savannahsolver</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by savannahsolver\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Hv9bQF5x1yQ\">https://youtu.be/Hv9bQF5x1yQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=qpvS2PVkI8A\">https://youtube.com/watch?v=qpvS2PVkI8A</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Basic_Computation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Basic_Computation)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Basic Computation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Basic Computation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_C4ceJn6Iaw\">https://youtu.be/_C4ceJn6Iaw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Hawk Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzwxbsuSQ80\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzwxbsuSQ80</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gLahuINjRzU\">https://youtu.be/gLahuINjRzU</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EMzdnr1nZcE\">https://youtu.be/EMzdnr1nZcE</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p